        "original_id": "9cbb0f84-3a19-56b7-92fd-bf78fb5a58d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Garabedian, Charles A. Agemian\n- Companies: Chase Manhattan Bank, Hackensack Trust Co., Garden State National Bank, CodComm, Inc.\n- Organizations: WPXC (FM)\n- Roles: radio personality, disc jockey, banker, executive vice president of operations, chairman, chief executive officer\n\nFacts:\n- John H. Garabedian was born on December 20, 1941 and is an American radio personality and disc jockey.\n- Charles A. Agemian was born on July 22, 1909 and died on March 30, 1996.\n- Charles A. Agemian was an American banker who was executive vice president of operations at Chase Manhattan Bank.\n- Charles A. Agemian took early retirement from Chase Manhattan Bank to become chairman and chief executive officer of Hackensack Trust Co.\n- Hackensack Trust Co. was later renamed Garden State National Bank.\n- WPXC (FM) is owned by John Garabedian through the licensee CodComm, Inc.",
